  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"2063\">\n<li data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1859\">\n<p data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1859\">Positive ANA with positive anti-dsDNA and/or anti-Sm suggests active SLE.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1920\">\n<p data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1920\">Low complement levels (C3, C4) support disease activity.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1976\">\n<p data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1976\">Anti-Ro and Anti-La may indicate overlap syndromes.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2063\">\n<p data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2063\">Negative panel does not completely rule out lupus; clinical correlation is required.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
